# CosDoubleAngle: three fixed real double-angle forms.
# Gate: target/release/litex -strict -f examples/proof_nodes/equal/by_builtin_rule/cos_double_angle.lit
# Before: each isolated direct assertion failed in search_proof.
# forall x R:
#     cos(2*x)=cos(x)^2-sin(x)^2
# forall x R:
#     cos(2*x)=1-2*sin(x)^2
# forall x R:
#     cos(2*x)=2*cos(x)^2-1
forall x R:
    cos(2*x)=cos(x)^2-sin(x)^2
    cos(2*x)=1-2*sin(x)^2
    cos(2*x)=2*cos(x)^2-1
forall x R:
    cos(x+x)=cos(x)*cos(x)-sin(x)*sin(x)
forall x R:
    2*cos(x)^2-1=cos(x*2)
# Boundary: sum instead of difference, wrong coefficients and complex inputs reject.
